# Data Consolidator

FastAPI server that serves generated weather + estate events (schema: `data_template.json`).

```bash
pip install fastapi uvicorn
cd data_consolidator
DATA_INTERVAL_SECONDS=60 uvicorn main:app   # interval defaults to 60 s
curl localhost:8000/app/data_events         # latest 60 events, newest first
```

Tests: `pip install pytest httpx && python -m pytest tests`
